  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support vulnerable children in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PAN helps over 26,000 vulnerable people living in the most remote rural areas of Colombia overcome adversity each year. By collaborating with those who are committed to making a difference, PAN aims to enhance its programs for children and their families. Through education, nutritional support, and healthcare, PAN works towards improving their quality of life, while also empowering them to make positive changes in their communities over the long term.</narrative>
  </description>
